<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Stanley rated accumulate.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Stanley rated accumulate.</headline>
<text>
<p>--NatWest Securities Corp said Wednesday it initiated coverage of Stanley Works with an accumulate rating.</p>
<p>--A massive restructuring effort underway at Stanley could produce $400 million in savings and $4 billion in sales by year end 1999, NatWest noted in a research report.</p>
<p>--NatWest's EPS estimates for the company are $1.83 in 1996 and $2.08 in 1997.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
